                        "iconUrl": null
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "enabled": true,
                "name": "Rules EN",
                "emoji": "🇺",
                "description": "Follow these rules to keep our community friendly and enjoyable.",
                "rules": "1. 🤝 Respect everyone. No harassment, bullying, discrimination, or personal attacks.\n\n2. 💬 Keep conversations appropriate and avoid excessive spam, flooding, or unnecessary mentions.\n\n3. 🚫 Do not share NSFW, offensive, illegal, or inappropriate content.\n\n4. 📢 No advertising or promoting other servers, communities, websites, or services without permission from the staff team.\n\n5. 🔒 Do not share personal information about yourself or other members.\n\n6. 🎮 Follow the rules of the Viora Minecraft SMP and respect other players.\n\n7. 🤖 Do not abuse, spam, or intentionally exploit Viora Bot or any other bots.\n\n8. 🛠️ Do not intentionally cause problems, exploit bugs, or attempt to disrupt the Discord or Minecraft server.\n\n9. 👮 Follow staff instructions. If you disagree with a decision, contact the staff team privately instead of starting arguments.\n\n10. ⚖️ Staff members may take action when necessary to protect the community, even in situations not explicitly covered by these rules.\n\nBy staying in Viora Community, you agree to follow these rules.",
                "embed": {
                    "color": "#8044ee",
